WEBVTT

00:00:04.120 --> 00:00:06.295
Dad wants us to pick
up where he left off

00:00:06.295 --> 00:00:09.691
Saving people, hunting
things, the family business.

00:00:10.473 --> 00:00:12.667
My dad had a partner on his last hunt.

00:00:12.667 --> 00:00:14.250
The guy screwed up, got my dad killed.

00:00:14.250 --> 00:00:16.325
What does this have to do
-It was your father, Dean.

00:00:16.325 --> 00:00:19.982
Maybe that's what the demon's doing
-Pushing us, finding ways to break us.

00:00:19.982 --> 00:00:20.743
I'm Meg.

00:00:20.743 --> 00:00:24.060
She's possessed --A human
possessed by a demon.

00:00:24.060 --> 00:00:28.579
Key of Solomon --You get a demon
in one, theyre trapped, powerless.

00:00:28.579 --> 00:00:32.236
Before dad died, he told
something -Something about you.

00:00:32.236 --> 00:00:35.403
He said that I had to save you, and
if I couldnt, Id have to kill you.

00:00:35.403 --> 00:00:36.906
Did he know the demon's plans for me?

00:00:36.906 --> 00:00:38.629
Am I supposed to go dark side?

00:00:38.629 --> 00:00:39.491
I never said that.

00:00:39.491 --> 00:00:42.246
You're not careful; you will
have to waste me one day, Dean.

00:00:47.056 --> 00:00:48.950
Ellen, its me again.

00:00:50.132 --> 00:00:51.545
Any chance you've heard from him?

00:00:53.379 --> 00:00:56.174
I swear, its like looking
for my dad all over again.

00:00:56.174 --> 00:00:57.787
I'm losing my mind here.

00:00:57.787 --> 00:00:59.280
I've called him a thousand times.

00:00:59.280 --> 00:01:00.332
It's nothing but voice mail.

00:01:00.332 --> 00:01:02.086
I don't know where he went or why.

00:01:02.086 --> 00:01:03.739
Sam's just gone.

00:01:05.042 --> 00:01:05.884
Hang on.

00:01:09.180 --> 00:01:10.553
Sammy, where the hell are you?

00:01:10.553 --> 00:01:11.495
Are you okay?

00:01:11.495 --> 00:01:12.326
Hey, hey, hey, hey.

00:01:12.326 --> 00:01:13.008
Calm down.

00:01:13.008 --> 00:01:13.729
Where are you?

00:01:13.729 --> 00:01:14.330
Don't move.

00:01:14.330 --> 00:01:15.503
I'm on my way.

00:01:39.972 --> 00:01:41.104
Sam, its me.

00:01:43.158 --> 00:01:43.859
Sam!

00:01:49.260 --> 00:01:50.222
Sam?

00:01:54.962 --> 00:01:55.763
Hey.

00:01:56.976 --> 00:01:58.238
Hey, Dean.

00:02:00.893 --> 00:02:01.745
Are you bleeding?

00:02:02.697 --> 00:02:03.889
I tried to wash it off.

00:02:07.406 --> 00:02:08.218
Oh, my god.

00:02:11.234 --> 00:02:12.507
I don't think its my blood.

00:02:12.507 --> 00:02:13.288
Whose is it?

00:02:13.288 --> 00:02:14.340
I don't know.

00:02:14.340 --> 00:02:15.863
Sam, what the hell happened?

00:02:16.996 --> 00:02:17.727
Dean...

00:02:20.082 --> 00:02:21.605
I don't remember anything.

00:02:37.126 --> 00:02:37.897
What did you find out?

00:02:38.789 --> 00:02:41.925
You checked in two days ago
under the name Richard sambora.

00:02:41.925 --> 00:02:45.623
I think the scariest part about this whole
thing is the fact that you're a bon jovi fan.

00:02:45.623 --> 00:02:46.524
Dean.

00:02:46.524 --> 00:02:47.857
Your room's been quiet.

00:02:47.857 --> 00:02:49.390
Nobody's noticed anything unusual.

00:02:49.390 --> 00:02:52.396
You mean no one saw me walking
around covered in blood?

00:02:53.258 --> 00:02:54.420
Yeah, thats what I mean.

00:02:54.420 --> 00:02:56.154
Then how the hell did I get here?

00:02:56.154 --> 00:02:56.925
What happened to me?

00:02:56.925 --> 00:03:00.613
I don't know, but you're
okay, and that's what matters.

00:03:00.613 --> 00:03:01.384
Everything else, we can deal with.

00:03:01.384 --> 00:03:02.296
Oh, really?

00:03:02.296 --> 00:03:04.781
'Cause what if I hurt someone or worse?

00:03:04.781 --> 00:03:05.953
Sam.

00:03:09.250 --> 00:03:10.883
What if this is what
dad warned you about?

00:03:10.883 --> 00:03:11.845
Come on, man.

00:03:11.845 --> 00:03:12.857
Let's not jump the gun here.

00:03:12.857 --> 00:03:14.210
We don't know what happened.

00:03:14.210 --> 00:03:16.274
We got to treat this like any other job.

00:03:16.274 --> 00:03:17.767
What's the last thing you remember?

00:03:17.767 --> 00:03:22.416
Me and you in that
motel room in west Texas.

00:03:22.416 --> 00:03:24.771
We went out to grab some burgers.

00:03:24.771 --> 00:03:27.085
West Texas -That was over a week ago.

00:03:29.681 --> 00:03:30.663
That's it.

00:03:32.937 --> 00:03:34.831
Next thing I knew, I was sitting here...

00:03:34.831 --> 00:03:36.294
Bloody.

00:03:37.847 --> 00:03:39.751
I felt like I had been
asleep for a month.

00:03:39.771 --> 00:03:41.554
Okay, retrace your steps.

00:03:41.554 --> 00:03:44.530
Manager said you left yesterday
afternoon and never saw you come back.

00:03:50.993 --> 00:03:51.674
Hey.

00:04:01.694 --> 00:04:03.077
Recognize anything?

00:04:04.971 --> 00:04:05.903
Not really.

00:04:11.173 --> 00:04:11.875
Wait.

00:04:12.566 --> 00:04:13.248
What?

00:04:13.418 --> 00:04:14.440
I think I was here.

00:04:16.644 --> 00:04:17.556
You remember?

00:04:18.749 --> 00:04:20.081
Not really. It just...

00:04:21.213 --> 00:04:22.696
Feels familiar, you know?

00:04:28.668 --> 00:04:29.410
Try that one.

00:04:31.444 --> 00:04:32.276
Yeah.

00:04:32.626 --> 00:04:33.648
Okay.

00:04:36.574 --> 00:04:37.636
Wait.

00:04:55.231 --> 00:04:57.095
Please tell me you didn't steal this.

00:05:07.325 --> 00:05:08.197
More blood.

00:05:12.165 --> 00:05:13.969
Sam, backseat.

00:05:24.610 --> 00:05:26.323
You think I used this on someone?

00:05:27.947 --> 00:05:29.219
I'm not thinking anything.

00:05:36.754 --> 00:05:38.147
Okay, now, this is disturbing.

00:05:41.393 --> 00:05:41.925
Come on, man.

00:05:41.925 --> 00:05:43.137
This couldn't have been you.

00:05:43.237 --> 00:05:47.025
It could have been someone else
-Somebody who, uh, smokes menthols.

00:05:47.025 --> 00:05:51.183
Hey, a gas receipts, a few towns over.

00:05:55.993 --> 00:05:58.788
All right, receipts for10
gallons at pump number 2.

00:05:59.951 --> 00:06:02.165
You getting any goose bumps yet?

00:06:02.486 --> 00:06:05.492
"God, this looks familiar,"djavu vibes?

00:06:08.017 --> 00:06:09.500
Maybe someone inside will remember you.

00:06:10.411 --> 00:06:11.383
Come on.

00:06:19.530 --> 00:06:20.942
You -Out of here.

00:06:20.942 --> 00:06:21.494
Now.

00:06:21.494 --> 00:06:22.475
I'm calling the cops.

00:06:22.475 --> 00:06:23.387
You talking to him?

00:06:23.387 --> 00:06:24.640
Yeah, Im talking to him.

00:06:24.640 --> 00:06:28.988
Jerk comes in yesterday, stinking drunk,
grabs a 40 from the fridge, starts chugging it.

00:06:28.988 --> 00:06:29.680
This guy?

00:06:29.680 --> 00:06:31.083
You're drinking malt liquor?

00:06:31.083 --> 00:06:33.838
Not after he whipped the
bottle at my friggin' head.

00:06:33.838 --> 00:06:35.000
This guy?

00:06:35.000 --> 00:06:36.734
What, am I speaking Urdu?

00:06:36.734 --> 00:06:40.041
I'm really sorry if I did anything
tell your story walking, pal, okay?

00:06:40.041 --> 00:06:41.033
Popo will be here in five.

00:06:41.033 --> 00:06:41.594
Wait.

00:06:41.594 --> 00:06:42.556
He's leaving.

00:06:42.556 --> 00:06:43.517
Put the phone down.

00:06:43.517 --> 00:06:44.870
Sam, go wait in the car.

00:06:44.870 --> 00:06:46.443
But, Dean  go wait in the car!

00:06:52.706 --> 00:06:55.471
Okay, look, I just want to
talk to you that are it, okay?

00:06:59.630 --> 00:07:01.363
When he took off yesterday,
which way did he go?

00:07:01.363 --> 00:07:02.525
Why don't you ask him?

00:07:02.525 --> 00:07:03.878
'Cause I'm asking you.

00:07:03.878 --> 00:07:05.481
Please, youd be doing
mea huge favor, okay?

00:07:05.481 --> 00:07:07.135
Oh, do you a favor.

00:07:07.135 --> 00:07:09.139
Well, that is what I live for.

00:07:09.139 --> 00:07:14.529
You know, your buddy didn't pay for the booze
or the smokes, which he also illegally lit up.

00:07:14.529 --> 00:07:15.682
You saw him smoking?

00:07:15.682 --> 00:07:17.285
Yeah, guys a chimney.

00:07:23.197 --> 00:07:24.389
This, uh...

00:07:25.612 --> 00:07:26.684
Ought to cover it.

00:07:27.215 --> 00:07:30.702
Hmm, its, uh, its
coming back to me now.

00:07:30.702 --> 00:07:32.656
He took two packs.

00:07:35.521 --> 00:07:36.633
Of course he did.

00:07:41.373 --> 00:07:44.690
Heent north on route
71, straight out of town.

00:07:55.090 --> 00:07:57.205
What's going on with you, sam, hmm?

00:07:57.896 --> 00:08:02.395
The smoking, throwing bottles at people
-That sounds more like me than you.

00:08:02.806 --> 00:08:03.146
Dean, wait.

00:08:03.146 --> 00:08:04.299
Wait. Here.

00:08:04.559 --> 00:08:05.311
Turn down that road.

00:08:05.311 --> 00:08:05.792
What?

00:08:05.792 --> 00:08:06.393
I don't know how I know.

00:08:06.393 --> 00:08:07.335
I just do.

00:08:36.723 --> 00:08:39.008
Whoever lives here, Id say
they don't like surprises.

00:08:50.972 --> 00:08:51.924
Should we knock?

00:08:53.838 --> 00:08:55.030
Yeah, I guess.

00:09:00.641 --> 00:09:01.493
Hey, Dean.

00:09:08.978 --> 00:09:12.505
I'm surprised the cops didnt show -Place
like this you'd think would have an alarm.

00:09:18.908 --> 00:09:20.140
Yeah, you would.

00:09:54.128 --> 00:09:55.330
Hit the lights.

00:10:11.132 --> 00:10:12.234
Dean, I did this.

00:10:12.234 --> 00:10:13.006
We don't know that.

00:10:13.006 --> 00:10:14.058
What else do you need?

00:10:14.058 --> 00:10:17.024
How else do you explain the
car, the knife, the blood?

00:10:17.024 --> 00:10:17.525
I don't know, man.

00:10:17.525 --> 00:10:18.747
Why don't you tell me?

00:10:22.695 --> 00:10:28.797
Even if you did do this, Im sure you had a reason -You
know, self-Defense, he was a bad son of a bitch --Something.

00:10:36.452 --> 00:10:37.505
He doesn't have any I.D.

00:10:37.865 --> 00:10:39.028
I need your lock pick.

00:10:39.128 --> 00:10:39.679
What?

00:10:39.679 --> 00:10:40.931
I need your lock pick.

00:10:50.931 --> 00:10:53.276
Either this guys a
Unabomber -Or a hunter.

00:10:54.038 --> 00:10:55.651
Dean, I think I killed a hunter.

00:10:59.198 --> 00:11:00.080
Let's find out.

00:11:06.703 --> 00:11:08.116
Here we go.

00:12:08.386 --> 00:12:10.180
How do you erase this, huh?

00:12:10.180 --> 00:12:11.352
Sam, come on.

00:12:11.352 --> 00:12:12.544
I need your help.

00:12:12.995 --> 00:12:14.027
I killed him, Dean.

00:12:15.831 --> 00:12:17.985
I just broke in and killed him.

00:12:19.508 --> 00:12:20.380
Listen to me.

00:12:21.071 --> 00:12:24.839
Whoever this guy is, hes a hunter, which means
other hunters are gonna look for his killer,

00:12:24.839 --> 00:12:27.053
Which means we got to
cover our tracks, okay?

00:12:30.370 --> 00:12:32.003
His name was Steve Wandell.

00:12:33.606 --> 00:12:35.410
This is a letter from his daughter.

00:12:57.304 --> 00:12:59.147
Wipe your prints. Then we go.

00:13:10.239 --> 00:13:13.746
All right, we get a couple hours' sleep, and
then we put this place in our rearview mirror.

00:13:15.810 --> 00:13:17.283
I know this is bad, okay?

00:13:18.055 --> 00:13:19.297
You got to snap out of it.

00:13:22.063 --> 00:13:23.165
Sam, say something.

00:13:24.348 --> 00:13:26.151
Just get some sleep and
leave in the morning?

00:13:27.263 --> 00:13:28.997
Murder, Dean
--That's what I did.

00:13:29.979 --> 00:13:31.352
Maybe, okay?

00:13:31.352 --> 00:13:33.065
Hey, we don't
--Shapeshifter.

00:13:33.065 --> 00:13:34.177
Oh, come on.

00:13:34.177 --> 00:13:34.838
You know it wasnt.

00:13:34.838 --> 00:13:35.530
You saw the tape.

00:13:35.530 --> 00:13:37.083
There was no eye flare, no distortion.

00:13:37.083 --> 00:13:39.167
But it wasn't you, all right?

00:13:39.167 --> 00:13:41.852
Yeah, it might have been
you, but it wasn't you.

00:13:42.644 --> 00:13:43.706
Well, I think it was.

00:13:49.528 --> 00:13:50.931
I think maybe more than you know.

00:13:52.363 --> 00:13:53.526
What the hell does that mean?

00:13:54.909 --> 00:13:56.732
For the last few weeks,
Ive been having...

00:13:58.706 --> 00:14:00.099
I've been having these feelings.

00:14:00.961 --> 00:14:01.963
What feelings?

00:14:02.263 --> 00:14:03.015
Rage...

00:14:04.397 --> 00:14:05.389
Hate.

00:14:06.682 --> 00:14:07.764
And I can't stop it.

00:14:09.397 --> 00:14:10.610
It just gets worse.

00:14:10.780 --> 00:14:12.323
Day by day, it gets worse.

00:14:13.967 --> 00:14:14.939
You never told me this.

00:14:17.113 --> 00:14:18.335
I didn't want to scare you.

00:14:20.680 --> 00:14:22.023
Well, bang-Up job on that.

00:14:25.950 --> 00:14:29.317
Dean, the yellow-Eyed demon
-You know he has plans for me.

00:14:29.598 --> 00:14:32.333
And we both know that hes turned
other children into killers before, too.

00:14:32.333 --> 00:14:34.097
No one can control you but you.

00:14:34.097 --> 00:14:35.059
It sure doesn't seem like that, Dean.

00:14:35.059 --> 00:14:39.578
It feels like no matter what I do, slowly
but surely, Im just becoming --What?

00:14:40.389 --> 00:14:41.461
Who I'm meant to be.

00:14:42.153 --> 00:14:43.756
You said it onceyourself, Dean.

00:14:43.756 --> 00:14:44.958
I got to face up to who I am.

00:14:44.958 --> 00:14:45.840
I didn't mean this!

00:14:45.840 --> 00:14:47.193
But it's still true.

00:14:47.193 --> 00:14:48.415
You know that.

00:14:48.415 --> 00:14:49.477
Dad knew that, too.

00:14:49.477 --> 00:14:51.722
That's why he told you
if it ever came to this

00:14:51.722 --> 00:14:52.674
Shut up, Sam.

00:14:54.928 --> 00:14:56.481
Dean, you promised him.

00:14:57.443 --> 00:14:58.455
You promised me.

00:15:01.291 --> 00:15:02.123
No.

00:15:03.255 --> 00:15:04.177
Listen to me.

00:15:04.798 --> 00:15:06.702
We're gonna figure this out, okay?

00:15:06.702 --> 00:15:08.906
I mean, theres got to be a way, right?

00:15:10.439 --> 00:15:11.321
Yeah, there is.

00:15:20.299 --> 00:15:21.862
I don't want to hurt anyone else.

00:15:24.026 --> 00:15:25.399
I don't want to hurt you.

00:15:28.145 --> 00:15:29.056
You wont.

00:15:29.778 --> 00:15:32.403
Whatever this is, you can fight it.

00:15:32.493 --> 00:15:34.588
No, I cant...

00:15:36.101 --> 00:15:37.553
Not forever.

00:15:39.257 --> 00:15:40.630
Here. You got to do it.

00:15:57.413 --> 00:15:59.267
You know, Ive tried so
hard to keep you safe.

00:16:00.028 --> 00:16:00.830
I know.

00:16:10.680 --> 00:16:11.621
I cant.

00:16:13.595 --> 00:16:15.179
I'd rather die.

00:16:21.030 --> 00:16:21.872
No.

00:16:23.906 --> 00:16:25.269
You'll live.

00:16:39.317 --> 00:16:41.060
You'll live to regret this.

00:17:09.677 --> 00:17:10.990
It's past your checkout.

00:17:22.593 --> 00:17:23.274
What?

00:17:23.465 --> 00:17:26.381
It's past checkout, and I have a
couple here that need your room.

00:17:29.647 --> 00:17:31.010
Yeah, Ill bet they do.

00:17:31.801 --> 00:17:32.503
What time is it?

00:17:32.503 --> 00:17:33.675
12:30.

00:17:35.880 --> 00:17:37.423
The guy that was with
me --Have you seen him?

00:17:37.423 --> 00:17:43.124
Yeah, he left before dawn in your car, and you should have
gone with him because now I'm gonna have to charge you extra.

00:17:44.016 --> 00:17:45.369
Oh, son of a bitch.

00:17:45.479 --> 00:17:46.761
It's just policy, sir.

00:17:46.761 --> 00:17:48.385
I need to use your computer.

00:17:48.385 --> 00:17:51.070
Why would I let you use my computer?

00:17:54.637 --> 00:17:55.278
Hi.

00:17:55.278 --> 00:18:00.699
Uh, so sorry to bother you, but, uh, my
son snuck out of the house last night and,

00:18:00.699 --> 00:18:03.214
Uh, went to a Justin Timberlake concert.

00:18:04.627 --> 00:18:05.168
What?

00:18:06.320 --> 00:18:06.912
Yeah.

00:18:07.212 --> 00:18:08.956
Justin is quite the triple threat.

00:18:09.537 --> 00:18:12.944
Uh, anyway, hes not back
yet, and I'm starting to worry.

00:18:14.727 --> 00:18:16.681
Right, yeah, boys will be boys.

00:18:16.681 --> 00:18:17.954
But, see, Sammy is a...

00:18:18.685 --> 00:18:23.274
Diabetic, and if he doesn't get his
insulin, then I just --I have to find him.

00:18:25.208 --> 00:18:26.451
Please, Im begging you.

00:18:27.763 --> 00:18:29.577
No, no, no, Im on
the website right now.

00:18:29.577 --> 00:18:31.811
I just need to activate
the GPS on his cellphone.

00:18:35.519 --> 00:18:36.320
Yeah, right there.

00:18:36.320 --> 00:18:37.883
Duluth, Minnesota.

00:18:38.034 --> 00:18:40.008
Yeah, that is a long
way to go for a concert.

00:18:40.008 --> 00:18:41.110
I appreciate your help.

00:18:48.595 --> 00:18:49.096
Night.

00:18:49.096 --> 00:18:50.168
Thank you.

00:18:52.392 --> 00:18:53.394
Sorry, were closing up.

00:18:56.200 --> 00:18:57.693
How about just one for the road?

00:19:01.521 --> 00:19:03.474
Well, youre about the last
person I'd expect to see.

00:19:06.190 --> 00:19:07.022
Well...

00:19:08.645 --> 00:19:10.258
I guess I'm full of surprises.

00:19:12.673 --> 00:19:14.226
So, can I get a beer?

00:19:15.398 --> 00:19:16.210
Sure.

00:19:16.921 --> 00:19:17.913
One beer.

00:19:30.308 --> 00:19:31.641
So, howd you find me?

00:19:33.965 --> 00:19:37.072
Well, uh, its kind of
what we do, you know?

00:19:37.923 --> 00:19:39.947
Speaking of "we,?Wheres Dean?

00:19:39.947 --> 00:19:41.240
Couldn't make it.

00:19:44.236 --> 00:19:45.318
So, what are you doing here, Sam?

00:19:46.140 --> 00:19:48.394
We didn't exactly part
on the best of terms.

00:19:50.108 --> 00:19:50.969
Right.

00:19:53.033 --> 00:19:54.045
Thats why I'm here.

00:19:55.578 --> 00:19:58.925
I kind of wanted to see if we
could square things, you know?

00:19:59.997 --> 00:20:01.049
That looks like it hurts.

00:20:03.264 --> 00:20:03.915
No.

00:20:04.566 --> 00:20:05.318
No, just...

00:20:06.280 --> 00:20:07.963
Had a run-In with a hot stove.

00:20:08.504 --> 00:20:11.039
So, you were saying something
about squaring things?

00:20:11.039 --> 00:20:12.061
Yeah.

00:20:16.861 --> 00:20:21.420
Look, I know how you feel about my
dad, and I can't say I blame you.

00:20:22.131 --> 00:20:29.266
He was obsessed, consumed with hunting, and
he didn't care who got caught in the crossfire.

00:20:31.480 --> 00:20:33.474
And I guess that included your dad.

00:20:34.847 --> 00:20:35.879
But that was my father.

00:20:36.290 --> 00:20:37.161
That's not me.

00:20:39.646 --> 00:20:40.438
What about Dean?

00:20:42.432 --> 00:20:45.408
Well, Deans more like my
father than I am, but he...

00:20:51.961 --> 00:20:52.833
Boy...

00:20:55.057 --> 00:20:57.151
Youre really carrying a
torch for him, arent you?

00:20:59.205 --> 00:21:00.308
I'll take that as a yes.

00:21:04.797 --> 00:21:05.638
It's too bad.

00:21:06.630 --> 00:21:08.674
'Cause, see, Dean, he
likes you, sure, but...

00:21:08.895 --> 00:21:10.157
Not in the way you'd want.

00:21:11.380 --> 00:21:18.163
I mean, maybe as kind of a little sister,
but romance -That's just out of the question.

00:21:20.137 --> 00:21:22.332
He Kind of thinks youre
a schoolgirl, you know?

00:21:26.069 --> 00:21:27.482
I'm not trying to hurt you, Jo.

00:21:27.482 --> 00:21:31.149
I -I'm telling you cause I care.

00:21:31.149 --> 00:21:32.843
That's real kind of you, Sam.

00:21:34.105 --> 00:21:34.927
I mean it.

00:21:39.947 --> 00:21:41.400
I care about you a lot.

00:21:41.580 --> 00:21:42.672
Sam, whats going on?

00:21:47.001 --> 00:21:48.774
I can be more to you, Jo.

00:21:49.526 --> 00:21:50.528
Maybe you should leave.

00:21:54.265 --> 00:21:55.147
Okay.

00:22:05.528 --> 00:22:06.600
Sam, get off me!

00:22:06.901 --> 00:22:08.363
Sam, get off me!

00:22:08.363 --> 00:22:09.426
Let go.

00:22:14.656 --> 00:22:16.390
Jo, Jo, Jo.

00:22:23.263 --> 00:22:24.596
Sam, no, pleases!

00:22:24.596 --> 00:22:25.418
Please.

00:22:39.045 --> 00:22:41.029
It didn't have to be this way.

00:22:43.674 --> 00:22:45.147
Maybe it did.

00:23:00.297 --> 00:23:01.620
What the hell's going on?

00:23:02.341 --> 00:23:03.674
What are you doing?

00:23:04.235 --> 00:23:09.005
So, what exactly did your mom
tell you about how your dad died?

00:23:09.936 --> 00:23:10.828
You're not Sam.

00:23:11.159 --> 00:23:12.141
Don't be so sure about that.

00:23:12.141 --> 00:23:13.173
Answer the question....

00:23:19.986 --> 00:23:20.628
Come on.

00:23:23.223 --> 00:23:24.175
It's me.

00:23:24.996 --> 00:23:25.718
You can tell me anything.

00:23:25.718 --> 00:23:26.840
You know that.

00:23:28.133 --> 00:23:30.237
Answer the question.

00:23:32.331 --> 00:23:33.032
Fine.

00:23:33.032 --> 00:23:34.165
Fine.

00:23:36.409 --> 00:23:39.545
Our dads were in California
-Devil's gate reservoir.

00:23:39.926 --> 00:23:41.950
They were setting a trap
for some kind of hell spawn.

00:23:43.133 --> 00:23:46.449
John was hiding, waiting,
and my dad was bait.

00:23:48.153 --> 00:23:49.776
That's just like john.

00:23:50.227 --> 00:23:53.103
Oh, I bet he dangled
bill like meat on a hook.

00:23:53.103 --> 00:23:53.894
Then what?

00:23:56.810 --> 00:23:57.892
The thing showed up.

00:23:58.323 --> 00:24:02.732
John got too eager, jumped out too soon,
and got my dad exposed out in the open.

00:24:04.736 --> 00:24:05.968
The thing turned around...

00:24:07.181 --> 00:24:08.173
And killed him.

00:24:12.812 --> 00:24:13.563
Not quite.

00:24:16.820 --> 00:24:17.481
What?

00:24:18.002 --> 00:24:18.493
What?

00:24:19.666 --> 00:24:20.708
See, it hurt him.

00:24:21.950 --> 00:24:23.143
It didn't kill him.

00:24:25.888 --> 00:24:27.591
You really don't know the truth, do you?

00:24:29.625 --> 00:24:31.028
I bet your momdoesn't, either.

00:24:31.499 --> 00:24:32.261
Know what?

00:24:32.551 --> 00:24:33.613
You see, bill...

00:24:35.277 --> 00:24:36.399
Was all clawed up.

00:24:38.082 --> 00:24:39.876
He was holding his insides in his hands.

00:24:41.289 --> 00:24:42.461
He was gargling and...

00:24:43.884 --> 00:24:45.968
Praying to see you and
Ellen one more time.

00:24:47.641 --> 00:24:48.834
So my dad...

00:24:51.279 --> 00:24:52.461
Killed him.

00:24:54.295 --> 00:24:56.689
He put him out of his
misery like a sick dog.

00:24:56.750 --> 00:24:57.291
You're lying.

00:24:57.291 --> 00:24:57.732
I'm not.

00:24:57.732 --> 00:24:58.724
It's true.

00:24:59.174 --> 00:25:02.541
My daddy shot your daddy in the head

00:25:02.541 --> 00:25:03.874
How could you know that?

00:25:03.874 --> 00:25:04.846
I hear things.

00:25:07.190 --> 00:25:08.463
Why are you doing this to me?

00:25:08.463 --> 00:25:09.695
Like daddy, like daughter.

00:25:09.695 --> 00:25:10.437
You're bait.

00:25:10.437 --> 00:25:11.269
Open up.

00:25:12.531 --> 00:25:13.964
That's a girl.

00:25:15.287 --> 00:25:16.068
Sam!

00:25:17.832 --> 00:25:19.405
I begged you to stop me, Dean!

00:25:19.635 --> 00:25:20.517
Put the knife down, damn it.

00:25:20.517 --> 00:25:22.200
I told you I can't fight it!

00:25:22.641 --> 00:25:24.976
My head feels like
its on fire, all right?

00:25:26.048 --> 00:25:29.224
Dean, kill me, or I'm gonna kill her.

00:25:30.206 --> 00:25:31.048
Please.

00:25:31.048 --> 00:25:32.230
You'd be doing me a favor.

00:25:33.934 --> 00:25:34.755
Shoot me.

00:25:38.172 --> 00:25:39.204
Shoot me!

00:25:48.523 --> 00:25:49.846
No, sammy.Come on.

00:25:54.114 --> 00:25:55.266
What the hells wrong with you, Dean?

00:25:56.629 --> 00:25:59.795
Are you that scared of being
alone that you'd rather let Jo die?

00:26:03.162 --> 00:26:05.226
That's holy water, you
demonic son of a bitch!

00:26:18.623 --> 00:26:20.928
He was possessed?

00:26:23.332 --> 00:26:25.336
Dean!

00:26:43.773 --> 00:26:47.380
So, who are you? I got lots of names.

00:26:54.795 --> 00:26:57.000
You've been in Sam since
he Disappeared, havent you?

00:26:57.100 --> 00:27:02.811
Should have seen your face when you
thought He murdered that guy. Pathetic.

00:27:08.222 --> 00:27:12.130
Why didn't you kill me?
You had a dozen chances.

00:27:16.438 --> 00:27:20.346
No, that would have been too
easy. Where's the fun in that?

00:27:20.446 --> 00:27:26.258
See, this was a test. I wanted to see If
I could push you far enough to waste Sam.

00:27:27.761 --> 00:27:30.466
I should have known you
wouldn't have the sack.

00:27:30.567 --> 00:27:32.971
Anyway, funs over now.

00:27:33.072 --> 00:27:37.280
Well, I hope you got your kicks
'cause you're gonna pay hell for this.

00:27:37.380 --> 00:27:42.190
How? You can't hurt me
- Not without hurting your little brother.

00:27:43.392 --> 00:27:51.809
See, I think you're gonna die, Dean
- You and every other hunter I can find.

00:27:53.512 --> 00:27:59.424
One look at Sams dewy, sensitive eyes,
And they'll let me right in that door.

00:29:11.268 --> 00:29:13.071
This is Dean. Leave a message.

00:29:41.728 --> 00:29:42.430
Dean!

00:29:43.532 --> 00:29:44.434
Dean!

00:29:48.442 --> 00:29:50.045
Take it easy.

00:29:50.947 --> 00:29:53.652
Where's Sam? I don't know.
Ive been looking for you.

00:29:53.752 --> 00:29:56.358
Come on. Get up.

00:30:03.772 --> 00:30:06.678
Okay. Dont be a baby!

00:30:06.979 --> 00:30:07.780
God.

00:30:09.384 --> 00:30:12.790
All right, almost. All
right, got it. Got it.

00:30:19.303 --> 00:30:22.810
God, youre a butcher. You're welcome.

00:30:23.612 --> 00:30:26.518
All right, are we done? Would you
give me two minutes to patch you up?

00:30:27.119 --> 00:30:29.424
You can't help Sam if
you're bleeding to death.

00:30:31.428 --> 00:30:34.333
So, how did you know
that he was possessed?

00:30:35.836 --> 00:30:40.045
I didnt. I just knew that
It couldn't have been him.

00:30:41.147 --> 00:30:43.351
Hey, Dean. Yeah.

00:30:44.654 --> 00:30:48.762
I know demons lie, But do
they ever tell the truth, too?

00:30:51.167 --> 00:30:56.377
Yeah, sometimes, I guess, especially
If they know it'll mess with your head.

00:30:59.383 --> 00:31:00.987
Why do you ask?

00:31:02.189 --> 00:31:05.395
Nothing. It doesn't matter.

00:31:05.496 --> 00:31:07.600
So, do you have any idea?
Where he's headed to next?

00:31:07.800 --> 00:31:13.011
So far, hes been going after the nearest hunter,
So, the closest one I know is in South Dakota.

00:31:13.211 --> 00:31:15.315
Okay, good. Im done. Lets go.

00:31:17.119 --> 00:31:21.327
You're not coming. The hell
I'm not. Im a part of this now.

00:31:21.528 --> 00:31:26.738
I can't say it more plain than this you try and
follow me, And I'll tie you right back to that post.

00:31:26.838 --> 00:31:29.944
This is my fight. Im not
getting Your blood on my hands.

00:31:30.045 --> 00:31:31.748
That's just how it's gonna be.

00:31:35.656 --> 00:31:39.363
Wait. Here.

00:31:41.768 --> 00:31:44.073
Take these. Theyll help with the pain.

00:31:47.279 --> 00:31:48.181
Thanks.

00:31:51.588 --> 00:31:53.592
I'll call you later, okay?

00:31:59.303 --> 00:32:01.207
No, you wont.

00:32:22.449 --> 00:32:24.052
Damn it.

00:32:36.678 --> 00:32:38.882
Sam. Hey, bobby.

00:32:39.082 --> 00:32:42.489
It's been a while. Come on in.

00:32:50.305 --> 00:32:55.014
So, what brings you? Working a job nearby,
and I thought I'd stop in and say hey.

00:32:55.215 --> 00:32:58.221
Where's Dean?

00:32:58.321 --> 00:33:01.126
Holed up somewhere with
a girl and a 12-Pack.

00:33:01.427 --> 00:33:07.439
Oh, yeah? Is she pretty? You ask
me, hes in way over his head.

00:33:10.044 --> 00:33:11.547
Well, its good to see you.

00:33:13.752 --> 00:33:14.553
To john.

00:33:16.758 --> 00:33:18.561
To dad.

00:33:32.389 --> 00:33:35.595
What'd you do? Little
holy water in the beer.

00:33:35.996 --> 00:33:41.106
Sam never would have noticed,
But, then, youre not Sam, are you?

00:33:41.307 --> 00:33:44.313
Don't try to con a con man.

00:33:54.333 --> 00:33:55.134
Ugh!

00:34:13.872 --> 00:34:17.579
Dean. Back from the dead.

00:34:17.880 --> 00:34:20.385
Getting to be a regular
thing for you, isnt it?

00:34:21.587 --> 00:34:22.288
Like a cockroach.

00:34:22.389 --> 00:34:24.994
How about I smack that smart-Ass
Right out of your mouth?

00:34:25.094 --> 00:34:26.096
Careful now.

00:34:26.196 --> 00:34:31.306
Wouldn't want to bruise this fine packaging
Oh, dont worry. This isn't gonna hurt Sam much.

00:34:32.208 --> 00:34:33.912
You, on the other hand...

00:34:37.819 --> 00:34:40.425
Feel like talking now?

00:34:40.926 --> 00:34:43.130
Sam's still my meat puppet.

00:34:43.932 --> 00:34:47.839
I'll make him bite off his tongue.
No, you won't be in him long enough.

00:34:48.441 --> 00:34:49.443
Bobby.

00:34:57.559 --> 00:35:04.673
Ee, whatever bitch-Boy master plan you demons Are
cooking up, youre not getting Sam, you understand me?

00:35:04.873 --> 00:35:07.879
'Cause I'm gonna kill
every one of you first.

00:35:19.703 --> 00:35:24.513
You really think that's what this is about
- The master plan?

00:35:25.014 --> 00:35:29.322
I don't give a rat's ass
about the master plan.

00:35:33.030 --> 00:35:37.138
Oops.Doesn't seem to be working.

00:35:37.639 --> 00:35:39.843
See, I learned a few new tricks.

00:35:56.276 --> 00:35:59.482
This isn't going like I
pictured. What's going on, bobby?

00:36:02.689 --> 00:36:04.793
It's a binding link!

00:36:05.094 --> 00:36:08.801
It's like a lock. Its locked
Itself inside Sams body.

00:36:08.901 --> 00:36:11.406
What the hell do we do? I don't know!

00:36:21.025 --> 00:36:24.132
There. Thats better.

00:36:33.049 --> 00:36:36.757
You know when people want to
describe The worst possible thing...

00:36:37.057 --> 00:36:39.162
They say it's like hell?

00:36:40.063 --> 00:36:44.372
Well, theres a reason for
that. Hell is like, uh...

00:36:47.178 --> 00:36:51.186
Well, its like hell, even for demons.

00:36:52.288 --> 00:36:57.999
It's a prison made of bone
and Flesh and blood and fear.

00:37:01.506 --> 00:37:04.212
And you sent me back there.

00:37:05.314 --> 00:37:09.422
Meg. No...Not anymore.

00:37:09.622 --> 00:37:11.326
Now I'm Sam.

00:37:13.731 --> 00:37:15.133
By the way...

00:37:16.536 --> 00:37:19.943
I saw your dad there. He says "howdy."

00:37:20.544 --> 00:37:26.656
All that I had to hold on to was that I would
Climb out one day and that I was gonna torture you,

00:37:26.957 --> 00:37:30.965
Nice and slow, like pulling
the wings off an insect.

00:37:31.566 --> 00:37:36.376
But whatever I do to you, its nothing
compared To what you do to yourself, is it?

00:37:36.877 --> 00:37:38.981
I can see it in your eyes, Dean.

00:37:39.282 --> 00:37:42.789
You're worthless. You
couldn't save your dad

00:37:42.989 --> 00:37:48.300
And deep down, you know that
You can't save your brother.

00:37:49.201 --> 00:37:51.406
They'd have been better off without you.

00:38:20.664 --> 00:38:22.167
Sammy?

00:38:26.175 --> 00:38:28.380
Did I miss anything?

00:38:41.706 --> 00:38:45.113
By the way, you really
look like crap, Dean.

00:38:45.814 --> 00:38:47.818
Yeah, right back at you.

00:38:53.730 --> 00:38:55.133
What is it, bobby?

00:38:56.035 --> 00:38:59.241
You boys ever hear of a
hunter Named Steve Wandell?

00:39:00.544 --> 00:39:02.448
Why do you ask?

00:39:03.149 --> 00:39:09.161
Just heard from a friend, wandells dead
- Murdered in his own house.

00:39:10.764 --> 00:39:13.169
You wouldn't know anything about that.

00:39:13.369 --> 00:39:15.975
No, sir.Never heard of the guy. Dean.

00:39:16.075 --> 00:39:18.580
Good. Keep it that way.

00:39:18.780 --> 00:39:22.488
Wandell's buddies are looking for
Someone or something to string up.

00:39:22.788 --> 00:39:25.393
They're not gonna slow
down to listen to reason.

00:39:25.794 --> 00:39:27.798
You understand what I'm saying?

00:39:29.301 --> 00:39:31.205
We better hit the road...

00:39:31.506 --> 00:39:34.411
If, uh, you can remember
where we parked the car.

00:39:34.612 --> 00:39:36.516
Here. Take these.

00:39:39.221 --> 00:39:44.131
What are they? Charms.
Theyll fend off possession.

00:39:44.231 --> 00:39:48.439
That demon's still out there. This will
Stop it from getting back up in you.

00:39:48.640 --> 00:39:52.447
That sounds vaguely dirty,
but, uh, thanks. You're welcome.

00:39:52.948 --> 00:39:56.756
You boys be careful, now. You too.

00:40:22.107 --> 00:40:24.211
You okay?

00:40:25.814 --> 00:40:27.517
Sam?

00:40:29.321 --> 00:40:30.624
Is that you in there?

00:40:35.133 --> 00:40:37.437
I was awake for some of it, Dean.

00:40:39.642 --> 00:40:47.157
I watched myself kill Wandell with my own
two hands. I saw the light go out in his eyes.

00:40:49.361 --> 00:40:51.064
It must have been awful.

00:40:53.469 --> 00:40:55.473
That's not my point.

00:40:57.177 --> 00:40:59.581
I almost carved up jota.

00:40:59.682 --> 00:41:02.387
But no matter what I
did, you wouldn't shoot.

00:41:02.988 --> 00:41:05.493
It was the right move,
sam.It wasn't you.

00:41:05.593 --> 00:41:09.501
Yeah, this time. What about next time?

00:41:13.108 --> 00:41:20.924
Sam, when dad told me that I might have to
kill you, It was only if I couldn't save you.

00:41:21.525 --> 00:41:24.431
Now, if it's the last thing
I do, I'm gonna save you.

00:41:32.948 --> 00:41:33.349
What?

00:41:34.351 --> 00:41:35.453
Nothing.

00:41:36.956 --> 00:41:38.459
Dean, what?

00:41:38.559 --> 00:41:44.271
Dude, you, like, full-On had a girl
inside you for, Like, a whole week.

00:41:47.277 --> 00:41:48.679
That's pretty naughty.

00:00:04.481 --> 00:00:05.984
